Player] Component\n(LLM does not generate player or HTML)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"3FL71TCidY9SII-4BsLkM","type":"text","x":1165.228744506836,"y":477.5,"width":329.5425109863281,"height":175,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f59e0b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b08","roundness":null,"seed":1647738727,"version":3,"versionNonce":1853455049,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1790071838208,"created":1790071838206,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Multi-Layer Guardrail Architecture\n-----------------------------------------------\nLayer 1: Agent System Instructions\n* Never invent Quran, Hadith, or Fatwa\n* Never fabricate isnad, grading, or scholars\n* Say \"\u0644\u0627 \u0623\u0639\u0644\u0645\" when authorized evidence is lacking\n\nLayer 2: Backend Evidence Enforcement\n* Deterministic gatekeeper\n* Blocks answers not backed by tool payloads","fontSize":14,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"guardrails_box","originalText":"Multi-Layer Guardrail Architecture\n-----------------------------------------------\nLayer 1: Agent System Instructions\n* Never invent Quran, Hadith, or Fatwa\n* Never fabricate isnad, grading, or scholars\n* Say \"\u0644\u0627 \u0623\u0639\u0644\u0645\" when authorized evidence is lacking\n\nLayer 2: Backend Evidence Enforcement\n* Deterministic gatekeeper\n* Blocks answers not backed by tool payloads","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"B-faAbCbJ6_LuME0sqfCu","type":"text","x":1139.67724609375,"y":697.5,"width":380.6455078125,"height":175,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#ef4444","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b09","roundness":null,"seed":1444936327,"version":3,"versionN