/tool,\n  not a new routing architecture!","fontSize":14,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"extensibility_box","originalText":"Future Extensibility (No Redesign Needed)\n-----------------------------------------------\n* Add New Domains: Seerah, Aqeedah, Usul al-Fiqh\n  -> Plug in new MCP server & tool\n* Multi-Client: Web first -> Desktop (BYOK) later\n* Conflicting Sources Comparison UI\n* Principle: Add a trusted source/tool,\n  not a new routing architecture!","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","currentItemFontFamily":1}}